<title>USA: Littlefield says Blumenfeld talks to go on.</title>
<headline>Littlefield says Blumenfeld talks to go on.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co said on Monday that it has agreed with Michael Blumenfeld to continue discussions regarding Blumenfeld's interest in the company beyond April 8.</p>
<p>Blumenfeld's proposal to invest $1 million in the company through the purchase of newly issued common shares, announced on April 2, had contained a deadline of April 8.</p>
